  title: Healing Potion
  tab: 3
  picture: {fileID: -5717049752745662821, guid: 961aee62321df4c40b9eaca0050d1354, type: 3}
  loreText: "A village healer\u2019s first lesson, scribbled on the back of an old
    map:\n\n\u201CCrush one Wardleaf until it weeps. Add a single Emberbloom petal
    and watch the water warm without fire. Pour it into clean glass and seal it quickly,
    before the warmth escapes.\u201D\n\nSimple enough for any traveller to brew by
    a campfire, and worth more than gold when the road turns dangerous."
